# Use Bun

| Prefer | Avoid |
| --- | --- |
| `bun <file>` | `node` / `ts-node` for app scripts |
| `bun test` | jest / vitest (unless app already standardized) |
| `bun install` | npm / yarn / pnpm install |
| `bun run <script>` | npm/yarn/pnpm run |
| `bunx` | npx |

- Bun loads `.env` — prefer that over adding dotenv for Bun scripts
- Tests: `import { test, expect } from "bun:test"` when using Bun's runner

Frontend bundlers already in the product (Vite / TanStack Start) stay as configured — do not force Bun.serve HTML imports onto existing apps.
